1"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cGloom and Doom is proof that short games can also deliver in the areas of story, characterisation, and most importantly, enjoyment.\u201d<br>Geek Culture<br><br>\u201cThis is not your average visual novel.  Gloom and Doom is a masterpiece hidden in a brown paper wrapper, and hopefully you unwrap it.\u201d<br>Real Otaku Gamer<br><br>\u201cThe art consistently pops, and the character designs are some of the most distinctive and stylish I\u2019ve seen in visual novels.\u201d<br>Fair Plays by Wes<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372800/ss_858da00da9ec704ea61ac1c18160bb63a64d2a7b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1664718196","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372800/ss_858da00da9ec704ea61ac1c18160bb63a64d2a7b.600x338.jpg?t=1664718196"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372800/ss_87a05bc93e733f6f53d2199c16b4531273ed9c20.1920x1080.jpg?t=1664718196","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372800/ss_87a05bc93e733f6f53d2199c16b4531273ed9c20.600x338.jpg?t=1664718196"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372800/ss_45fa3769439585deb382b818f22f27a1b76eb0be.1920x1080.jpg?t=1664718196","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372800/ss_45fa3769439585deb382b818f22f27a1b76eb0be.600x338.jpg?t=1664718196"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372800/ss_c6f7a9474d838d94e6d98c15acf96b6a40cfebb2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1664718196","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372800/ss_c6f7a9474d838d94e6d98c15acf96b6a40cfebb2.600x338.jpg?t=1664718196"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372800/ss_de4511e2ac7bfa059